      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/university_park_iowa",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Almost all of University Park’s 0.78 square miles is urbanized, featuring residential neighborhoods and the historic Vennard College campus.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
